# Country-Side Pizza, Veneta, Oregon

6/17/2025

The best pizza in at least 10 miles around Eugene. It's affordable, You can get an extra-large pepperoni pizza for $23.25!

It tastes amazing, smells amazing, and is filling. I usually get a rolled crust pepperoni pizza, medium or large, and it's never been bad. Always consistent, which for me, is incredibly important.

[Their website](https://countrysidepizzaandgrill.com)
